  "finding": "Qualified support for the trusted-data API temporal guard by source inspection; feature-level acceptance remains unproven. Recommend retaining publication-cutoff regression and requiring versioned feature definitions, training-only fit lineage and out-of-sample stability evidence before feature-store acceptance.",
  "requirement": "Feature inputs must be filtered by both bar end and publication availability at the historical query cutoff; preserve dataset and transformation lineage for reproduction.",
  "failure_case": "A completed 2026-11-25 bar with close 100.5 and publication at 21:01 UTC must not enter a feature queried at 21:00 or 21:00:59, even after the simulation clock advances. Filtering on bar end alone leaks future information.",
  "limitations": [
    "Source inspection and in-memory arithmetic validation only; existing integration test was read, not executed. No backtest or campaign rerun.",
    "Returned manifest does not expose feature definitions, fitted normalization state, per-feature publication timestamps or feature-store lineage. Dataset hashes alone cannot prove end-to-end feature temporal integrity.",
    "43 synthetic rows from configured 2026-07-01 to 2026-09-01 are below six months; no out-of-sample evaluation, feature stability, predictive contribution, or 30 days actual simulation established.",
    "Synthetic local evidence only; no external data obtained. Dataset row-level publication dates and licence provenance are not provided by the manifest. Counterexample dates are invented fixture dates, not observed market events.",
    "No adversarial sandbox, M16 pass, strategy eligibility, professional approval or final release pass claimed. Source checkout identity was not matched to the running service bundle."
  ],
